# The Dockerfile only needs web/. Keep the Foundry tree and all build output out
# of the context. Patterns are matched against the whole path, so anchor the
# repo-root ones with a leading slash — a bare `src/` would also strip web/src.
**/node_modules
**/.next
/out
/cache
/lib
/broadcast
/src
/test
/script
/foundry.toml
/remappings.txt
/package.json
/package-lock.json
